(134, 1, '2014-12-16 03:58:45', '2014-12-16 03:58:45', '&nbsp;\n\n<a href=\"http://pmdiy.or.id/wp-content/uploads/2014/12/musywil-pm-diy.jpg\"><img class=\"aligncenter wp-image-139\" src=\"http://pmdiy.or.id/wp-content/uploads/2014/12/musywil-pm-diy.jpg\" alt=\"musywil pm diy\" width=\"581\" height=\"387\" /></a>\n\nMusyawarah Wilayah Pemuda Muhammadiyah DIY akan diselenggarakan besok tanggal 27 - 28 Desember 2014 di SMK Muhammadiyah 1 Lendah. Terkait sukses acara tersebut, Panitia Pemilihan (Panlih) yang diketuai Nur Cahyoprobo telah berhasil menjaring usulan bakal calon (balon) Ketua Formatur dan Anggota formatur dari PD Pemuda Muhammadiyah se - DIY dan PW Pemuda Muhammadiyah DIY.\n\nAdapun hasil penjaringan bakal calon (balon) Ketua Formatur dan Anggota formatur adalah sebagai berikut :\n\nBakal Calon Ketua Formatur :\n<table width=\"355\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"30\"><span style=\"color: #0000ff;\">No</span></td>\n<td width=\"197\"><span style=\"color: #0000ff;\">Nama Bakal Calon</span></td>\n<td width=\"128\"><span style=\"color: #0000ff;\">Tinggal di Kab/Kota</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>Ridwan Furqoni</td>\n<td>Bantul</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>Iwan Setiawan</td>\n<td>Kota Yogyakarta</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>Hatib Rahmawan</td>\n<td>Sleman</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>Muh. Harpan</td>\n<td>Kota Yogyakarta</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>Ghifari Yuristiadi</td>\n<td>Kota Yogyakarta</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>Misbahul Munir</td>\n<td>Kulon Progo</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>7</td>\n<td>Irwan Triyanto</td>\n<td>Gunungkidul</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>Sandro Andriawan</td>\n<td>Sleman</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n&nbsp;\n\nBakal Calon Anggota Formatur :\n<table width=\"355\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"30\"><span style=\"color: #0000ff;\">No</span></td>\n<td width=\"197\"><span style=\"color: #0000ff;\">Nama Bakal Calon</span></td>\n<td width=\"128\"><span style=\"color: #0000ff;\">Tinggal di Kab/Kota</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>Andi Putra Wijaya</td>\n<td>Bantul</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>David Nugroho</td>\n<td>Bantul</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>Fida Afif</td>\n<td>Bantul</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>Fredy Oksana</td>\n<td>Bantul</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>Latif Ajron</td>\n<td>Bantul</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>Miftah Farid</td>\n<td>Bantul</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>7</td>\n<td>Nanang Setyo Prakoso</td>\n<td>Bantul</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>Nasmi Zartian</td>\n<td>Bantul</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>9</td>\n<td>Hernawan</td>\n<td>Gunung Kidul</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>10</td>\n<td>Rohmad Qomarudin</td>\n<td>Gunung Kidul</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>11</td>\n<td>Irwan Triyanto</td>\n<td>Gunungkidul</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>12</td>\n<td>Dani Fadhillah</td>\n<td>Kota Yogyakarta</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>13</td>\n<td>Dani Kurniawan</td>\n<td>Kota Yogyakarta</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>14</td>\n<td>Erizal</td>\n<td>Kota Yogyakarta</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>15</td>\n<td>Fitri Arianto</td>\n<td>Kota Yogyakarta</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>16</td>\n<td>Ghifari Yuristiadi</td>\n<td>Kota Yogyakarta</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>17</td>\n<td>Imam Mahdi</td>\n<td>Kota Yogyakarta</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>18</td>\n<td>M. Harpan</td>\n<td>Kota Yogyakarta</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>19</td>\n<td>Niam Arrozi</td>\n<td>Kota Yogyakarta</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>20</td>\n<td>Norrahman</td>\n<td>Kota Yogyakarta</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>21</td>\n<td>Tri Antoro Sholeh</td>\n<td>Kota Yogyakarta</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>22</td>\n<td>Andrie Pratama</td>\n<td>Kulon Progo</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>23</td>\n<td>Burhani Arwin</td>\n<td>Kulon Progo</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>24</td>\n<td>Dian Korprianing N</td>\n<td>Kulon Progo</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>25</td>\n<td>Misbahul Munir</td>\n<td>Kulon Progo</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>26</td>\n<td>Rhomandika Cahyo Nugroho</td>\n<td>Kulon Progo</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>27</td>\n<td>Aditya Johan Ramadhan</td>\n<td>Sleman</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>28</td>\n<td>Darojat Nur Ahmad</td>\n<td>Sleman</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>29</td>\n<td>Hatib Rahmawan</td>\n<td>Sleman</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>30</td>\n<td>Joko Ariyanto</td>\n<td>Sleman</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>31</td>\n<td>M.H Abror</td>\n<td>Sleman</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>32</td>\n<td>Sandro Andriawan</td>\n<td>Sleman</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>33</td>\n<td>Slamet Suhartono</td>\n<td>Sleman</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n&nbsp;\n\nSelanjutnya Panlih mengirimkan surat pemberitahuan pencalonan, kesediaan dan biodata bakal calon ketua dan anggota formatur ke nama - nama tersebut diatas. Demikian rilis ini disampaikan oleh Rhomandika Cahyo Nugroho, A.Md, Wakil Ketua PW PM DIY bidang Litbang &amp; Media Informasi. (rcn)', 'Bakal Calon Ketua & Anggota Formatur Musywil Pemuda Muhammadiyah DIY', '', 'publish', 'open', 'open', '', 'calon-ketua-anggota-formatur-musywil-pm-diy', '', '', '2014-12-16 03:58:45', '2014-12-16 03:58:45', '', 0, 'http://pmdiy.or.id/?p=134', 0, 'post', '', 2),
