(1599, 1, '2019-10-05 10:24:18', '2019-10-05 03:24:18', '<div class=\"\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"ctc9f\" data-offset-key=\"5bbuu-0-0\">\n<div class=\"_1mf _1mj\" data-offset-key=\"5bbuu-0-0\"><strong>YUK INVESTASI DUNIA - AKHIRAT</strong></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"ctc9f\" data-offset-key=\"dghn8-0-0\">\n<div class=\"_1mf _1mj\" data-offset-key=\"dghn8-0-0\"><strong>PATUNGAN DONASI PERALATAN LIVE STREAMING</strong></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"ctc9f\" data-offset-key=\"va93-0-0\">\n<div class=\"_1mf _1mj\" data-offset-key=\"va93-0-0\"><strong>KAJIANMU &amp; MANTAB (PWPM DIY)</strong></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"ctc9f\" data-offset-key=\"1vlnt-0-0\">\n<div class=\"_1mf _1mj\" data-offset-key=\"1vlnt-0-0\"><strong> </strong></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"ctc9f\" data-offset-key=\"ua5c-0-0\">\n<div class=\"_1mf _1mj\" data-offset-key=\"ua5c-0-0\"><strong>\"HANYA 100 RIBU PER LEMBAR DONASI\"</strong></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"ctc9f\" data-offset-key=\"f4gsv-0-0\">\n<div class=\"_1mf _1mj\" data-offset-key=\"f4gsv-0-0\"><span data-offset-key=\"f4gsv-0-0\"> </span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"ctc9f\" data-offset-key=\"ada0u-0-0\">\n<div class=\"_1mf _1mj\" data-offset-key=\"ada0u-0-0\">Bismillahirrahmaanirrahiim...</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"ctc9f\" data-offset-key=\"aaqae-0-0\">\n<div class=\"_1mf _1mj\" data-offset-key=\"aaqae-0-0\"><span data-offset-key=\"aaqae-0-0\"> </span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"ctc9f\" data-offset-key=\"bkfrl-0-0\">\n<div class=\"_1mf _1mj\" data-offset-key=\"bkfrl-0-0\"><span data-offset-key=\"bkfrl-0-0\">Menurut survei CISCO &amp; Forbes, masa depan dunia adalah di dunia video online. Kata mereka, \"by 2020, 82% of consumer internet traffic will be video\".</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"ctc9f\" data-offset-key=\"fompn-0-0\">\n<div class=\"_1mf _1mj\" data-offset-key=\"fompn-0-0\"><span data-offset-key=\"fompn-0-0\"> </span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"ctc9f\" data-offset-key=\"2ljti-0-0\">\n<div class=\"_1mf _1mj\" data-offset-key=\"2ljti-0-0\"><span data-offset-key=\"2ljti-0-0\">Alangkah meruginya, bilamana dakwah Muhammadiyah tidak sampai menseriusi ramalan ilmiah ini. Hari ini sudah kita lihat dengan mata kepala sendiri, gerakan-gerakan Islam, Ustadz-ustadz Islam berlomba-lomba membuat content-content video dakwah di Youtube, Instagram dan Facebook.</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"ctc9f\" data-offset-key=\"5jnov-0-0\">\n<div class=\"_1mf _1mj\" data-offset-key=\"5jnov-0-0\"><span data-offset-key=\"5jnov-0-0\"> </span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"ctc9f\" data-offset-key=\"cep43-0-0\">\n<div class=\"_1mf _1mj\" data-offset-key=\"cep43-0-0\"><span data-offset-key=\"cep43-0-0\">Problemnya, selama ini PWPM DIY hanya mengadakan live streaming dengan alat yang seadanya. Silakan cek channel <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCsFS-jCZPa_sA8wJ8flaIDw\"><strong>KAJIANMU YOUTUBE</strong></a>. Sayang sekali, alat-alat yang kami miliki pun sebenarnya sudah uzur, hanya handycam sederhana yang dibeli tahun 2016 lalu. </span><span class=\"_3gl1 _5zz4\" data-offset-key=\"cep43-1-0\"><span class=\"_ncl\"><span data-offset-key=\"cep43-1-0\">😥</span></span></span></div>\n</div>\n<div data-offset-key=\"cep43-0-0\"></div>\n<div data-offset-key=\"cep43-0-0\"><a href=\"http://pemudamuhdiy.or.id/wp-content/uploads/2019/10/72071495_895844377460415_5956446485032730624_o.jpg\"><img class=\"aligncenter wp-image-1602 size-large\" src=\"http://pemudamuhdiy.or.id/wp-content/uploads/2019/10/72071495_895844377460415_5956446485032730624_o-1024x768.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"696\" height=\"522\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"ctc9f\" data-offset-key=\"59ur3-0-0\">\n<div class=\"_1mf _1mj\" data-offset-key=\"59ur3-0-0\"><span data-offset-key=\"59ur3-0-0\"> </span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"ctc9f\" data-offset-key=\"3c6rb-0-0\">\n<div class=\"_1mf _1mj\" data-offset-key=\"3c6rb-0-0\"><span data-offset-key=\"3c6rb-0-0\"><strong>\"APAKAH MUHAMMADIYAH HANYA TERUS JADI PENONTON? ATAU MAU NAIK KELAS JADI YANG DITONTON?\"</strong> -- Itu pertanyaan besar yang menghantui kami.</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"ctc9f\" data-offset-key=\"399ie-0-0\">\n<div class=\"_1mf _1mj\" data-offset-key=\"399ie-0-0\"><span data-offset-key=\"399ie-0-0\"> </span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"ctc9f\" data-offset-key=\"88d5l-0-0\">\n<div class=\"_1mf _1mj\" data-offset-key=\"88d5l-0-0\"><span data-offset-key=\"88d5l-0-0\">Oleh karena itu, kami dari Pemuda Muhammadiyah DIY (PWPM DIY, khususnya Bidang Dakwah) ingin lebih serius menggarap dakwah video live streaming. Kami tidak ingin Muhammadiyah hanya jadi penonton saja di era video dakwah ini.</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"ctc9f\" data-offset-key=\"6e6r1-0-0\">\n<div class=\"_1mf _1mj\" data-offset-key=\"6e6r1-0-0\"><span data-offset-key=\"6e6r1-0-0\"> </span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"ctc9f\" data-offset-key=\"5dqh-0-0\">\n<div class=\"_1mf _1mj\" data-offset-key=\"5dqh-0-0\"><span data-offset-key=\"5dqh-0-0\">Kami berharap dapat mengadakan live streaming yang lebih baik lagi: lebih jernih gambarnya, lebih jernih suaranya. Tentu dengan alat-alat live streaming yang baru dan lebih canggih.</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"ctc9f\" data-offset-key=\"33vhg-0-0\">\n<div class=\"_1mf _1mj\" data-offset-key=\"33vhg-0-0\"><span data-offset-key=\"33vhg-0-0\"> </span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"ctc9f\" data-offset-key=\"4o8u8-0-0\">\n<div class=\"_1mf _1mj\" data-offset-key=\"4o8u8-0-0\"><span data-offset-key=\"4o8u8-0-0\">Adapun kebutuhan RAB utk pengadaan alat live streaming baru ini <strong>Rp. 60,000,000</strong>. Kami membuat sistem patungan donasi per lembarnya hanya 100,000. Terbuka 600 lembar donasi untuk seluruh jamaah.</span></div>\n</div>\n<div data-offset-key=\"4o8u8-0-0\"><a href=\"http://pemudamuhdiy.or.id/wp-content/uploads/2019/10/71902435_895844600793726_894042514049204224_o.png\"><img class=\"alignnone size-large wp-image-1604\" src=\"http://pemudamuhdiy.or.id/wp-content/uploads/2019/10/71902435_895844600793726_894042514049204224_o-1024x768.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"696\" height=\"522\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"ctc9f\" data-offset-key=\"c6van-0-0\">\n<div class=\"_1mf _1mj\" data-offset-key=\"c6van-0-0\"><span data-offset-key=\"c6van-0-0\"> </span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"ctc9f\" data-offset-key=\"8flgk-0-0\">\n<div class=\"_1mf _1mj\" data-offset-key=\"8flgk-0-0\"><span data-offset-key=\"8flgk-0-0\">Silakan konfirmasi kesediaan anda lewat </span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"ctc9f\" data-offset-key=\"6ds3o-0-0\">\n<div class=\"_1mf _1mj\" data-offset-key=\"6ds3o-0-0\"><strong>CP Panitia Pengadaan Edi Kurniawan (085743444082)</strong></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"ctc9f\" data-offset-key=\"415jh-0-0\">\n<div class=\"_1mf _1mj\" data-offset-key=\"415jh-0-0\"><span data-offset-key=\"415jh-0-0\"> </span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"ctc9f\" data-offset-key=\"dv259-0-0\">\n<div class=\"_1mf _1mj\" data-offset-key=\"dv259-0-0\"><span data-offset-key=\"dv259-0-0\">Lalu, patungan donasi bisa ditransfer melalui </span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"ctc9f\" data-o